      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHASING KISSES (2) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw then burst clear to score (17.24) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Form reads well for this. SHIPLEY'S GIRL (1) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Grade 5 win two back (23.02) at The Gardens. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Well placed here and can atone this time. REDEEM A ARCADIA (4) has good early dash but last time was shuffled out the back and missed the frame, finishing eighth (18.17) in a Grade 5 at this track. Prior to that was quickly into stride and scored (18.17) at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Bold showing expected. RUNAWAY SAM (7) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when second (18.12) in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide.",
